{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Color Pro X Accurate Picker 是一款專業級取色工具，以相機即時捕捉眼前顏色，並提供準確的 6 位 HEX 色碼，方便 UI 設計師、平面設計師、室內設計師、畫家及網頁開發者配對品牌色與畫面用色。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>專業級離線取色工具</h2>\n<p>以相機對準物件即可即時捕捉顏色，配合白平衡校正確保還原準確，並輸出可靠的 6 位 HEX 色碼，避免出現錯誤的 5 位碼，同時支援 RGB、CMYK、HSL 及 LAB 格式。內置色彩比較、智能歷史記錄與調色盤管理，可匯出 ASE、CSS、JSON 及文字檔，完全離線運作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-399-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-400-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-401-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-402-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-403-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-404-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Color Pro X Accurate Picker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T14:19:18.094761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}